sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gmail as Gmail (IMAP)
    participant W as Mail watcher
    participant C as Triage cron
    participant R as Triage router
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant LLM as Model (TRIAGE_LLM)
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant T as Trace file
    participant M as Inbox manager

    Gmail-->>W: IDLE: inbox changed
    W->>Gmail: UIDs after cursor, FETCH message
    W->>DB: save as pending
    W->>W: save cursor (UIDVALIDITY:UID)
    C->>DB: untriaged rows, every TRIAGE_INTERVAL_SECONDS
    C->>R: triage_new_email(message, source=cron)
    R->>R: check_source -> pre_triage
    R->>Gmail: Sent folder has a later message in this thread?
    alt already replied
        R->>R: user_reply_complete, rule pre_triage
    else Gmail says promotions / social / forums / spam / muted, or the sender is on the ignore list
        R->>R: ignore, rule gmail_* / label_* / ignore_list_*
    else needs the model
        R->>Mem: preferences block (recall)
        R->>LLM: system prompt (scaffold + memory), user turn (email)
        LLM-->>R: category, reason, rule (structured)
        R->>R: reply category without a learned rule? downgrade to notify
    end
    R->>T: pre_triage and triage lines
    R->>DB: save
    R->>Mem: sender-stable ignore -> pre-triage ignore list
    alt auto_schedule or auto_draft
        R->>M: handle(message)
        M-->>R: action recorded on the email
    end
    R-->>C: message
